{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18495","headline":"陪太原郑行军中丞登汾上阁中丞诗曰汾楼秋水阔宛似到阊门惆怅江湖思惟将南客论南客即詹也辄书即事上荅 · 欧阳詹","name":"陪太原郑行军中丞登汾上阁中丞诗曰汾楼秋水阔宛似到阊门惆怅江湖思惟将南客论南客即詹也辄书即事上荅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幷州汾上阁，登望似吴阊。\n贯郭河通路，萦村水逼乡。\n城槐临枉渚，巷市接飞梁。\n莫论江湖思，南人正断肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}